# Canonical Praxion baseline label-taxonomy-reconciler caller template — thin,
# SHA-pinned invoker of the public `reusable-labels-reconcile.yml` hub.
#
# The /onboard-project label-taxonomy onboarding sub-step (8e.9) installs this
# as `.github/workflows/labels-reconcile.yml` alongside `labels.yml.tmpl`, when
# neither `.github/labels.yml` nor this caller already exists — never
# overwriting an existing installation. Two placeholders are filled at install
# time:
#   {{PRAXION_HUB}} — the hub's owner/repo (francisco-perez-sorrosal/praxion).
#   {{HUB_SHA}}     — the hub's commit SHA, resolved at install time to a real
#     40-hex value — never left as an unresolved placeholder or a mutable
#     tag/branch; every other `uses:` in this ecosystem is SHA-pinned the same way.
#
# This caller stays thin: it owns only the real `push`-on-manifest-path +
# `workflow_dispatch` triggers and the least-privilege permission ceiling
# (`issues: write` + `contents: read` — the hub's job re-declares exactly the
# same grant, since GitHub caps the hub's effective token at the caller's own
# ceiling). The reconciliation logic (parsing the manifest, looping
# `gh label create --force`) lives entirely in the hub, not here.
#
# Praxion's own caller (`.github/workflows/labels-reconcile.yml`) differs only
# in the `uses:` ref: a same-repo local
# `uses: ./.github/workflows/reusable-labels-reconcile.yml` (tracks HEAD —
# correct for the repo that develops the hub), never a cross-repo SHA pin —
# the same deliberate divergence as `ci-autofix.yml.tmpl`'s and
# `cross-model-review.yml.tmpl`'s own caller #1.
# Delete this comment after tailoring.

name: Labels Reconcile

on:
  push:
    branches: [main]
    paths: [".github/labels.yml"]
  workflow_dispatch:

permissions: {}  # least-privilege; the job below grants only the ceiling the hub needs

jobs:
  reconcile:
    permissions:                          # ceiling GitHub caps the hub's
                                           # effective token at — must
                                           # re-declare exactly what the hub
                                           # job grants, no more, no less
      issues: write
      contents: read
    uses: {{PRAXION_HUB}}/.github/workflows/reusable-labels-reconcile.yml@{{HUB_SHA}}
    with:
      manifest_path: .github/labels.yml
